# 统一换行：仓库里一律 LF，检出时按平台转换。
# 本项目主要跑在 Windows，但 .py / .ts / .md 都是 LF，统一了才不会每个文件都报
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，也避免一次提交把整个仓库的换行都改掉。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要动
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mid binary
*.midi binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.whl binary
*.zip binary

# 各语言在 GitHub 上的统计归类
*.py linguist-language=Python
*.ts linguist-language=TypeScript
*.vue linguist-language=Vue

# 打包产物 / 生成物在 diff 里折叠
src/sheetsage2_webui/webui/static/assets/* linguist-generated=true
web/package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
